formal/p8/PROOF.md:233:  frame accepted in slot `kms` is never accepted in slot `gpg`, and the reverse.
formal/p8/PROOF.md:240:- (b) The manifest schema forces `fp_0` to have the prefix `spki-sha256:` and `fp_1` the prefix `gpg-sha256:`.
